This scenario adapts Lewis, Yarats, Dauphin, Parikh & Batra (2017), "Deal or No Deal? End-to-End Learning for
Negotiation Dialogues", EMNLP 2017, arXiv:1706.05125; dataset github.com/facebookresearch/end-to-end-negotiator (CC
BY-NC 4.0), which allows non-commercial use only. It is one of the scenarios of the non-commercial subset (`"nc":
true` in benchmark/index.json); the rest of the benchmark's text is CC BY 4.0 (LICENSE-DATA) and the code is MIT
(LICENSE). The leaderboard includes these scenarios, so a commercial use of the benchmark has to leave them out,
and its scores are then not comparable with the leaderboard.

Changes: the source was adapted into a benchmark scenario; source.md gives the citation, the quoted passages and what
was adapted. The source's authors do not endorse this benchmark.
